config BR2_PACKAGE_RSOS_HOMEBREW_OPEN
	bool "rsos-homebrew-open (open-licence supplement)"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_RSOS_HOMEBREW # rsos-seed-homebrew
	help
	  Optional supplement of open-licence homebrew games for the
	  systems that have no game in the approved set (SNES, GBA,
	  Master System, Game Gear, PS1, arcade). Downloaded from the
	  authors' releases and checked against
	  rsos-homebrew-open.hash. Default off until the owner has
	  reviewed the list in docs/homebrew.md.

	  The game list is still empty: the research is not finished.
